          "title": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">GOLEN ENGINE</span>",
          "meta": "By John Smith posted July 20, 2016",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "text-align": "left",
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-7s",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<p>Are you sick of not having enough power to climb those hills or did those larger tires you installed suck the life out of your stock 4.0L engine? The Golen Engine 4.6L Jeep Stroker Engine with its 270hp and 300 ft lbs of torque will bring life back to your Jeep and make it enjoyable to drive again!!</p><p><br></p><p><b>Facts you need to know about the 4.6L Jeep Stroker Engine:</b></p><ul><li>Built to be a direct bolt in for any year Jeep that has a 4.2L or 4.0L engine from the factory\n</li><li>Will pass emissions in all 50 states when running properly\n</li><li>Works fine with all automatic and std transmissions\n</li><li>Will not harm your front or rear differentials</li></ul><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>We Offer:</b></p><ul><li>No Core Charge or Sales Tax</li><li>Full Tech Support to help with Install and Startup</li><li>3 Year Warranty - Unlimited Mileage</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Find your model year below for more info.</b></p>",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "46px",
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#8c8c8c"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-7j",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "4",
            "paddingBottom": "4",
            "bgColor": "#000000"
          },
          "text": "<p>1991-2006 4.0L FUEL INJECTED JEEPS</p>",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_inherit": "msg-box5",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
