          "title": "INTRO WITH YOUTUBE VIDEO",
          "text": "<p>If you have a 4.0L fuel injected Jeep from 1991-2006 you can simply purchase our complete engine and swap all of the parts from your stock 4.0L engine onto the new 4.6L Stroker. &nbsp;There is no tuning needed on 1991-2006 year models, your stock computer will run the engine without a problem.</p>",
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\">MORE</a>",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
