          "text": "Our turnkey 4.6L Stroker Engine comes in both EFI and Carbureted options and is a direct replacement for your stock 4.2L Engine. &nbsp;Each engine comes Dyno tested and tuned so it is ready to run when you receive it and comes with a 3 year no mileage limit warranty.",
