          },
          "_anchor": "content1-8i",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "1",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><b>Pricing on 4.6L Jeep Carb Turn Key for 1971-1990 Jeeps:</b></span></font></div><ul><li><b>1971-1990</b> year models <b>$7,699 </b><a href=\"https://lamynes.github.io/aboutme/\" class=\"text-warning\">Buy Now</a></li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Parts and Services Included in Jeep Carb Turn Key Engine:</b></p><ul><li>Dyno Break In and Tuning Service\n</li><li>Oil pan\n</li><li>Timing cover\n</li><li>Slinger and Buffer for timing cover\n</li><li>Oil pan and timing cover bolt kit\n</li><li>Valve Cover Kit w/ Golen 4.6L Badge\n</li><li>Valve Cover Breathers with PCV\n</li><li>Harmonic balancer pulley\n</li><li>Labor to install covers\n</li><li>Joe Gibbs 10w40 Break In Oil\n</li><li>Oil filters (3)\n</li><li>Spark plugs\n</li><li>Performance intake manifold\n</li><li>Performance tubular stainless steel header\n</li><li>Holley 390cfm Carb w/electric choke\n</li><li>HEI Distributor and Coil Kit\n</li><li>Performance Spark Plug Wires\n</li><li>Flowkooler High Flow Water Pump\n</li><li>Thermostat Housing and Thermostat</li></ul>",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
