          "media": {
            "image": {
              "active": true,
              "width": 1400,
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mike-chitteck-2-resized.jpg",
              "link": "",
              "alt": "Mike Chittick Payson, Arizona",
              "title": "Mike Chittick Payson, Arizona"
            },
            "video": {
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tq7p44IA-1U",
              "aspectratio": "16:9",
              "autoplay": false,
              "loop": false
            },
            "iconFont": {
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-msg-box5",
              "link": "",
              "size": 0
            }
          },
          "title": "SOLID COLOR INTRO WITH IMAGE",
          "text": "Chad,\n<br>\n<br>My wife and I would like to Thank You for building our LS7 engine in our 2006 Z06 Corvette. To finally have an internally forged/balanced motor with a Superdeck block that will withstand boost and an 11:1 compression ratio is much more comforting than waiting for the standard equipment to fail. We have a good solid 750HP at the flywheel and 660RWHP. By the way, our motor was de-tuned from about 800HP to 750HP to deal with the Arizona heat issues. In addition, the blower cam you recommended keeps the power consistent throughout a wide RPM range. This adds a little more fun while accelerating. Also, the cylinder head work gave this engine a heck of a lot more airflow and dependability. At the last car show we attended an older spectator stated “This car has some Huevos”! Nice Job Chad! \n<br>\n<br>Mike Chittick Payson, Arizona",
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\">MORE</a>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "msg-box5",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "msg-box5-ln",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "showTitle": false,
            "showText": true,
            "showButtons": false,
            "inverse": true,
            "imageSize": 50,
            "paddingTop": "1",
            "paddingBottom": "1",
            "bgImageRadio": false,
            "bgImage": "@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/jumbotron.jpg",
            "parallax": true,
            "bgColorRadio": true,
            "bgColor": "#fff",
            "bgVideoRadio": false,
            "bgVideo": {
              "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNCr7NdOJgw"
            },
            "overlay": false,
            "overlayColor": "#fff",
            "overlayOpacity": 0.5
          },
          "media": {
            "image": {
              "active": true,
              "width": 1400,
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/testimonials-pablobolanos.jpg",
              "link": "",
              "alt": "Pablo Bolaños",
              "title": "Pablo Bolaños"
            },
            "video": {
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tq7p44IA-1U",
              "aspectratio": "16:9",
              "autoplay": false,
              "loop": false
            },
            "iconFont": {
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-msg-box5",
              "link": "",
              "size": 0
            }
          },
          "title": "SOLID COLOR INTRO WITH IMAGE",
          "text": "Chad,\n<br>\n<br>Looking for a powerful forged supercharged ready LS based engine for my 2000 TransAm wasn´t an easy task, most of it because here in Costa Rica there is no experience with this engine. \n<br>\n<br>When the company name, Golen Engine Service came to me I grab the phone, from the moment that Chad himself talked to me I knew that he was the right guy for the job. He listened to me, answered all my questions, make the best recommendations, and he had the patience to go all over the project several times just to be sure that we both were on the same frequency. He kept me updated during the entire process and helped me getting some extra parts needed for this project. \n<br>\n<br>The result, a complete beast LS2 402 supercharged engine ready to run. During the install we needed to call him an infinite times and he was always there to give us the right answer. \n<br>\n<br>Driving the car put a big smile on my face, but taking it to the dyno was the best of all, 687 RWHP @ 5800 rpm and 662 RWTQ @ 5300 rpm with 13 psi of boost, this on a very hot day with pump gas and without any knock. The engine runs excellent for daily use and it´s a very respectable contender on the track. \n<br>\n<br>My dream really come true, thank you for making this possible. \n<br>\n<br>Sincerely, \n<br>Pablo Bolaños\n<br>\n<br>",
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\">MORE</a>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "msg-box5",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            }
