          "_anchor": "content1-9a",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Our <b>416ci LT1/LT4 Short Block</b> makes a great upgrade for any LT Based vehicle. With Callies crank and rods and a Wiseco forged piston it can handle up to 900hp without any issues so a healthy shot of NOS is not a problem at all. We can build the short block to work with your heads and also offer options such as Comp Cams performance camshafts, CNC ported heads ect....</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Questions? Give us a call at <a href=\"tel:1-800-591-9171\" class=\"text-warning\">1-800-591-9171</a> or <a href=\"contact-us.html\" class=\"text-warning\">Contact Us</a> and we’ll get in touch with you right away.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></font></div><ul><li>PCustom Built to order\n</li><li>New GM LT1/LT4 Blocks\n</li><li>Base Price <b>$7199 </b><a href=\"https://lamynes.github.io/aboutme/\" class=\"text-warning\">Buy Now</a></li></ul>",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
