          "_anchor": "content1-9c",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Our <b>416ci LT1/LT4 Boosted Short Block</b> is made for a great replacement short block for the factory LT4 Super Charged engine or if you have a LT1 based Corvette or Camaro that you plan to install a turbo or super charger. With Callies crank and rods and a Wiseco boost ready forged piston it can handle up to 1100hp without any issues. We can build the short block to work with your heads and also offer options such as Custom Comp Cams boost camshafts, CNC ported heads ect....</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Questions? Give us a call at <a href=\"tel:1-800-591-9171\" class=\"text-warning\">1-800-591-9171</a> or <a href=\"contact-us.html\" class=\"text-warning\">Contact Us</a> and we’ll get in touch with you right away.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></font></div><ul><li>Custom Built to order\n</li><li>New GM LT1/LT4 Blocks\n</li><li>Base Price <b>$7199 </b><a href=\"https://lamynes.github.io/aboutme/\" class=\"text-warning\">Buy Now</a></li></ul><p><br></p>",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
