          },
          "title": "416ci LT1/LT4 LONG BLOCK ENGINE",
          "text": "<p><i><b>LONG BLOCK</b></i></p>",
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"416ci-lt1-lt4-long-block-engine.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">VIEW ENGINE SPECS</a>",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "text-align": "left",
              "font-family": "'Oswald', sans-serif",
              "googleLink": "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Oswald:400,300,700",
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "font-family": "'Oswald', sans-serif",
              "googleLink": "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Oswald:400,300,700",
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-9g",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Our <b>416ci LT1/LT4 600hp+ Long Block</b> can be custom built to make anywhere from 500hp to 650hp depending on the exact level or power you are looking to make. With quality components from manufactures such as Callies, Wiseco and ARP you can be sure that it will be a reliable performance engine that will last the long haul. We offer custom builds as well so if you do not see what you are looking for just ask.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Questions? Give us a call at <a href=\"tel:1-800-591-9171\" class=\"text-warning\">1-800-591-9171</a> or <a href=\"contact-us.html\" class=\"text-warning\">Contact Us</a> and we’ll get in touch with you right away.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></font></div><ul><li>Custom Built to order\n</li><li>New GM LT1/LT4 Blocks\n</li><li>Base Price: <b>Call for Pricing</b></li></ul>",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_inherit": "msg-box5",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "msg-box4",
          "_styles": {
            "H3": {
              "font-size": "36px",
