            "overlayOpacity": 0.5
          },
          "media": {
            "image": {
              "active": true,
              "width": 1400,
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/testimonials-stevefreeman.jpg",
              "link": "",
              "alt": "Steve Freeman",
              "title": "Steve Freeman"
            },
            "video": {
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tq7p44IA-1U",
              "aspectratio": "16:9",
              "autoplay": false,
              "loop": false
            },
            "iconFont": {
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-msg-box5",
              "link": "",
              "size": 0
            }
          },
          "title": "SOLID COLOR INTRO WITH IMAGE",
          "text": "First of all, after searching the web for engine builders and then comparing price, specs, parts, bang for the buck, it was hands down for Golen Engine. \n<br>\n<br>What really cemented the deal was talking to Chad, very up front, listened to what I wanted from my engine, what I was going to use it for (mostly street driving, with an occasional trip to the strip) ,answered all my questions. The engine I received was more than I had expected. Very thorough follow up before firing up the engine and Chad has kept in touch afterwards, wanting to know how the engine was doing. Would not hesitate to purchase another engine from him again, and have recommended his services to others.\n<br>\n<br>Steve Freeman",
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\">MORE</a>",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "msg-box5",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "msg-box5-hl",
          "_params": {
            "showTitle": false,
            "showText": true,
            "showButtons": false,
            "inverse": true,
            "imageSize": 50,
            "paddingTop": "1",
            "paddingBottom": "1",
            "bgImageRadio": true,
            "bgImage": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/enginewf.jpg",
            "parallax": true,
            "bgColorRadio": false,
            "bgColor": "#fff",
            "bgVideoRadio": false,
            "bgVideo": {
              "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNCr7NdOJgw"
            },
            "overlay": true,
            "overlayColor": "#ffffff",
            "overlayOpacity": "0.8"
          },
          "media": {
            "image": {
              "active": true,
              "width": 1400,
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/testimonials-jeffwills-2.jpg",
              "link": "",
              "alt": "Jeff Wills",
              "title": "Jeff Wills"
            },
            "video": {
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tq7p44IA-1U",
              "aspectratio": "16:9",
              "autoplay": false,
              "loop": false
            },
            "iconFont": {
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-msg-box5",
              "link": "",
              "size": 0
            }
          },
          "title": "SOLID COLOR INTRO WITH IMAGE",
          "text": "Hey Chad, \n<br>\n<br>I just wanted to let you know that a lot of jaws dropped last night at New England Dragway when they saw my pickup running 11.7′s at 118 in the heat right after a 2 hour highway trip. \n<br>\n<br>I had tons of compliments and they are all owed to you and your shop as I told them. My wife captured some cool video of the fans in the stands saying “ya’ right A Truck then to HOLY CRAP that’s fast”. \n<br>\n<br>I can’t thank you enough for the help and hopefully I sent some new customers who can enjoy your shops work! \n<br>\n<br>Keep it up!!! \n<br>Jeff Wills",
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\">MORE</a>",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "msg-box5",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "msg-box5-hm",
          "_params": {
            "showTitle": false,
            "showText": true,
            "showButtons": false,
            "inverse": true,
            "imageSize": 50,
            "paddingTop": "1",
            "paddingBottom": "1",
            "bgImageRadio": false,
            "bgImage": "@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/jumbotron.jpg",
            "parallax": true,
            "bgColorRadio": true,
            "bgColor": "#fff",
            "bgVideoRadio": false,
            "bgVideo": {
              "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNCr7NdOJgw"
            },
            "overlay": false,
            "overlayColor": "#fff",
            "overlayOpacity": 0.5
          },
          "media": {
            "image": {
              "active": true,
              "width": 1400,
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/testimonials-michaelfields4.jpg",
              "link": "",
              "alt": "Michael Fields",
              "title": "Michael Fields"
            },
            "video": {
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tq7p44IA-1U",
              "aspectratio": "16:9",
              "autoplay": false,
              "loop": false
            },
            "iconFont": {
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-msg-box5",
              "link": "",
              "size": 0
            }
          },
          "title": "SOLID COLOR INTRO WITH IMAGE",
          "text": "Dear Golen Engine Service,\n<br>\n<br>The engine I bought from you company has performed flawlessly for over three years now. I especially appreciated your knowledgeable and prompt response to the couple of questions I had when I was installing it.\n<br>\n<br>Your engine runs so well in my Camaro I replaced the TH350 with a 5-speed clutch-er. I get a lot of smiles to the miles. You sell a great product.\n<br>\n<br>Sincerely, \n<br>Michael Fields",
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\">MORE</a>",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
