            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-id",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "3",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<p>All engines sold in United States will be shipped via truck freight unless otherwise stated. We can ship to business or residential addresses and can provide a lift gate service if needed.</p><p><br></p><p>\n</p><p>We also offer air freight to anywhere in the world and ship outside the US on a weekly basis. If you are in need of a quote please call our sales dept at <a href=\"tel:1-800-591-9171\" class=\"text-warning\">1-800-591-9171</a> ext 1.</p><p><br></p><p>\n</p><p>\n</p><p>Each engine is properly bagged, shrink wrapped and crated in a custom wooden crate as seen in the pictures below. &nbsp;All small box of parts will be shipped via UPS ground within a 24 hour timeframe.</p>",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
