          "title1": "LS1 CRATE ENGINES",
          "subtitle1": "Bootstrap 4 has been noted",
          "caption1": "We offer a full line for high performance LS1 engines from short block to complete turnkey. We can customize the power level as well as the look and offer the components needed to make them fit your ride. Send an email or give us a call to get a quote today.",
          "button1": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media2": {
            "image": {
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/home-page-lsx-sm-1.jpg",
              "class": "card-img-top",
              "width": 600,
              "active": true,
              "link": "lt1-performance-engines.html",
              "alt": "LS1 RACE ENGINES",
              "title": "LS1 RACE ENGINES",
              "linkInNewWindow": false
            }
          },
          "title2": "LS1 RACE ENGINES",
          "subtitle2": "One of Bootstrap 4's big points",
          "caption2": "Golen’s LS1 Race Engines are suitable for road racing, drag racing, circle tracks, and even off-roading. Each is custom built, and with a range of <b>500hp</b> to <b>1500hp</b>, your race engine needs will most definitely be met – and then some!",
          "button2": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media3": {
            "image": {
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/lsx-race-sm.jpg",
              "class": "card-img-top",
              "width": 600,
              "active": true,
              "link": "lsx-complete-engines.html",
              "alt": "LSx CUSTOM ENGINES",
              "title": "LSx CUSTOM ENGINES",
              "linkInNewWindow": false
            }
          },
          "title3": "LSx CUSTOM ENGINES",
          "subtitle3": "Google has a highly exhaustive list of fonts",
          "caption3": "From street to race we offer full custom LSx engine builds up to 1500hp. We offer full in house dyno tuning to ensure your engine is broken in and ready to run once you get it!!!",
          "button3": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media4": {
            "image": {
              "src": "@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/gallery/code-man.jpg",
              "class": "card-img-top",
              "width": 600,
              "active": true
