        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "1",
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text": "<b>Machine Shop</b>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "font-size": "25px",
              "font-family": "'Oswald', sans-serif",
              "googleLink": "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Oswald:400,300,700"
            },
            "DIV": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "font-size": "30px"
            },
            "B": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-le",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "1",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<p>Our Machine Shop is equipped with all the necessary equipment to properly machine any high performance engine.</p><p><br></p><ul><li><b>Cylinder Boring:</b> Rottler Boring, we bore all cylinders within .005” of finish size to making the final honing as easy as possible.\n</li><li><b>\nBlock Decking:</b> Sunnen HBS-1300 , we are able to deck all blocks and cylinders in this machine for a straight and smooth finish&nbsp;</li><li><b>\nCylinder Honing: </b>Sunnen CV-15, this cylinder hone is state of the art and allows us to keep the cylinders straight and round&nbsp;</li><li><b>\nMainline Boring and Honing:</b> Sunnen CH-100, We can bore and line hone in this machine and blueprint main oil clearances to match the crankshaft&nbsp;</li><li><b>\nConnecting Rod Resizing:</b> Sunnen LBB-1660, resizing both big and small ends of connecting rods which allows us to blueprint oil clearances&nbsp;</li><li><b>\nCrankshaft Balancing: </b>Hines Balancer, this machine allows us to dynamically balance any crankshaft for super smooth operation and long engine life&nbsp;</li><li><b>\nCylinder Head Service:</b> Sunnen VGS-20 Seat and Guide Machine, we can perform up to a 5 angle performance valve job in this machine and it also allows us to install guides to size to keep the valve concentric to the valve seat for long life and max performance.</li></ul>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-l8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "0",
            "paddingBottom": "0",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<b>360</b>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_anchor": "content1-lc",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"mbr-section article mbr-section__container\" id=\"content1-lc\" data-rv-view=\"653\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-xs-12 lead\">\n      ​         <iframe height=\"600px\" width=\"100%\" src=\"https://momento360.com/e/u/1dce393d7778401a8dfd45a8b6c5adf2?utm_campaign=embed&amp;utm_source=other&amp;utm_medium=other\"></iframe>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n</section>",
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_customCSS": "P {\n  font-size: 17px;\n  text-align: left;\n  color: #000000;\n}\nUL {\n  font-size: 17px;\n  color: #000000;\n}\nDIV {\n  text-align: center;\n}\nB {\n  font-size: 30px;\n  color: #000000;\n}\n",
