          },
          "text": "<span style=\"font-size: 36px;\"><b>Dyno Tuning</b></span>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "font-size": "25px",
              "font-family": "'Oswald', sans-serif",
              "googleLink": "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Oswald:400,300,700"
            },
            "DIV": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "font-size": "30px"
            },
            "B": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-lg",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "1",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<p>We have not only one but two Superflow SF-902 Engine Dynos that allow us to properly break each engine in and monitor all engine vitals before full rpm testing. We can also tune both Carb and EFI to ensure the engine is making max power before you install. Customers are more than welcome to come to our shop to see their engine run or if you cannot visit we will gladly take a video of the engine running and post it on our Youtube Channel.</p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-la",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
