        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text": "<h1><b>Muscle Car Engines</b></h1><p>That muscle car in your garage is pretty special, but how about the engine? Does it deliver the power and torque your ride deserves? At Golen Engine, we build muscle car engines that give your car the “go” to match its “show.”<br></p><p><br></p><p> \n</p><p>\n</p><p>Whether you want stock looks and performance, gut-wrenching power and torque, or something in between, we can build it for you. Updates we perform include installing hydraulic roller camshafts, Viton valve stem seals and hardened exhaust seats. If there's something special you want, just ask because muscle car motors are our “thing!”</p><p><br></p><p>\n</p><p>\n</p><h5><b>Types of Muscle Car Engines\n</b></h5><p>If your special car came from the GM stable, we can help. We have a lot of experience building <a href=\"chevy-muscle-car-engines.html\" class=\"text-warning\">Chevy muscle car engines</a>. Pontiacs aren't left out either; we build <a href=\"pontiac-muscle-car-engines.html\" class=\"text-warning\">Pontiac muscle car engines</a>, too! If you're a fan of Chryslers, you can buy <a href=\"chrysler-muscle-car-engines.html\" class=\"text-warning\">Chrysler muscle car engines</a> from us. For Blue Oval devotees, we also build <a href=\"ford-muscle-car-engines.html\" class=\"text-warning\">Ford muscle car engines</a>.</p><p><br></p><p>\n</p><p>\n</p><h5><b>Attention to Detail\n</b></h5><p>Every one of our muscle car motors is special. When you buy an engine from us, you're getting the benefit of our deep engineering and machining expertise. We bore and deck in our shop rather than contracting the work, so we know the job is done right. We use premium U.S. components, we take the time to balance with care, and we'll even finish the block with factory color paint!\n</p><p>\n</p><p><b><br></b></p><h5><b>Break-In Service</b></h5><p>At <a href=\"https://golenengineservice.com\" class=\"text-warning\">Golen Engine Services</a>, we understand that once you installed your new muscle car performance engine, you'll want to use it. That's why we offer a dyno break-in service. Running your new motor on one of our SuperFlow engine dynamometers lets us get everything bedded-in before we ship it to you.<br></p><p>\n</p><p><b><br></b></p><h5><b>Invest in More Power</b></h5><p>With a few notable exceptions, stock muscle car engines of the past didn't make that much power, especially by today's standards. If you've decided it's time for more ponies under the hood, Golen Engine can help. Our custom muscle engines will give you stock power if that's what you want, or a lot, lot more.<br></p><p><br></p><p>\n</p><p>\n</p><h5><b><a href=\"contact-us.html\" class=\"text-warning\">Contact Us Today!</a></b></h5><p>Call 1-800-591-9171 to learn more about the types of muscle car engines we build. Or if it's easier, just complete our <a href=\"contact-us.html\" class=\"text-warning\">online form</a> and we'll get back to you.\n&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_anchor": "content1-1lv",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "H1": {
              "text-align": "center"
            }
          },
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "3",
