            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-ai",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<p>We offer a full line of LT1 short and long block engines that range from <b>400hp</b> to <b>700hp</b>. Each engine is balanced and blue printed to ensure maximum performance and reliability and the long blocks are all covered under our three year warranty.</p><p><br></p><ul><li>Quality parts from Scat, Mahle, Clevite and ARP\n</li><li>Balanced and Blueprinted\n</li><li>Custom Built to order!</li></ul>",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
