            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-an",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">We build each LT1 Long Block one at a time to be a direct bolt in for your car. All machine work and assembly is done in house and we can custom build to suit your performance needs.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Questions? Give us a call at <a href=\"tel:1-800-591-9171\" class=\"text-warning\">1-800-591-9171</a> or <a href=\"contact-us.html\" class=\"text-warning\">Contact Us</a> and we’ll get in touch with you right away.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></font></div><ul><li>6 Versions from <b>400hp</b> to <b>700hp\n</b></li><li>Custom Built to order\n</li><li>Quality parts from Comp Cams, Mahle and Scat</li></ul><p><br></p>",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "alias": "mobirise3-blocks/components",
          "_tags": [
            "Extension"
          ],
