            }
          },
          "title": "SOLID COLOR INTRO WITH IMAGE",
          "text": "Hey Chad,<br><br>Hope you are doing well.\n<br><br>Just touching base to let you know how it is going. The Jeep is a joy to drive, I drove it up the hill last weekend, which was never really enjoyable pre-stroker, but it basically just marched up the hill like nobody’s business.\n<br>\n<br>No more hunting for the right gear.\n<br><br>Did the 500 mile oil change this week.<br>\n<br>Thank you for a great experience.\n<br>Rick Scribner",
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\">MORE</a>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "msg-box5",
          "_styles": {
