        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text": "<p><b>Cleaning Process</b></p><p><b><br></b></p><p>We start off with a bare greasy block and put it into our electric oven where it bakes at 800 degrees for 5 hours. Once it comes out of the oven all the grease is turned to ash and it is ready for the blasting process. Our shot blaster shoots stainless steel shot at the block for 45 mins to get the cast iron back to new form.<br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
