          "title": "FACTORY<br>REPLACEMENT LS SHORT BLOCKS",
          "text": "<p><a href=\"#bottom\">Help?</a></p>",
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">QUESTIONS?</a>",
          "_anchor": "msg-box4-rz",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "text-align": "left",
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "1",
            "paddingBottom": "1",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<p>Our Factory Replacement Series short blocks are a great solution for your worn out LS factory power plant. We start off with all\n new GM blocks and cranks and then add a set of Scat 4340 forged steel rods and then top if off with a set of Speed Pro Hypereutectic Pistons. We build each Ls short block engine back to stock specs so you can use your factory or aftermarket performance cam and heads for a quick and easy install. Browse our ls short blocks for sale below and feel free to call our sales department to discuss your project today.</p><p><br></p><ul><li>Perfect replacement for your worn out LS short block<br></li><li>All new parts from GM, Scat and Speed Pro \n</li><li>Balanced and Blueprinted</li><li>See list of Ls1 short blocks and others below</li></ul>",
          "_anchor": "content1-s0",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text": "<p>Questions? Give us a call at <a href=\"tel:1-800-591-9171\" class=\"text-warning\">1-800-591-9171</a> or <a href=\"contact-us.html\" class=\"text-warning\">Contact Us</a> and we’ll get in touch with you right away.</p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
