          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "1",
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<p>Our line of Competition LSx Short Blocks are built from top quality components from well known manufactures such as GM, Callies, Mahle Motorsports, Wiseco, Clevite and ARP. We start with all brand new GM blocks as a rock solid foundation for each build and then performance machine and prep each one in house. We balance and blueprint each engine to exact tolerances before we final assemble.</p><p><br></p><ul><li><b>Good for up to 750hp\n</b></li><li>Balanced and Blueprinted in house\n</li><li>Custom LSx short block builds available</li></ul>",
          "_anchor": "content1-s8",
