          "title": "<p>LSx COMPETITION BOOSTED SHORT BLOCKS</p>",
          "text": "<p>Good for up to 1500hp, Boost Ready for LS Based Cars and Trucks, Great for Centrifugal and Twin Screws Super Chargers.</p>",
