          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "1",
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<p>This series of high performance ls short block engines works great for both Centrifugal and Twin Screw Style Super Chargers and can be custom built to work with Turbo Chargers as well. With quality parts such as Callies Forged Crank and Rods, Wiseco Forged Pistons and Clevite H-Series Performance Bearings they are able to handle big power!!!</p><p><br></p><ul><li><b>Good for up to 1500hp</b></li><li>High Performance Boost Ready for LS Based Cars and Trucks\n</li><li>Great for Centrifugal and Twin Screws Superchargers</li><li>We can Custom Build for Turbo Applications\n</li><li>Many Options Available</li></ul>",
