          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "0",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<h2>A Turnkey Upgrade for Your Corvette, Muscle Car or Hot Rod\n</h2><p>\nNothing lasts forever, not even a classic GM small block. When it's time for something new, consider turnkey Chevy crate engines. We specialize in LSx engines: short block, long block and complete. If you seek a quality LS motor for sale, you've come to the right place\n.</p><p><br></p>",
