          },
          "title": "<div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Base Price $18,699</span></div>",
          "text": "<p>This LSX 502 crate engine makes max power and torque with a hydraulic cam which\nis very street able but also gives you the sound you are looking for!!<br></p><p><b>Peak Horsepower: </b>700bhp @ 6800 rpm<br><b>Peak Torque:</b> 590lb/ft @ 5000 rpm<br><b>Compression Ratio:</b> 11.5:1\n<br><b>Operating Range:</b> 2500 – 6800rpm<br><b>Required Fuel:</b> 91+ Octane Pump Gasoline&nbsp;<br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"contact-us.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">Get Started Today</a> ",
          "_name": "msg-box4",
          "_styles": {
            "H3": {
              "font-size": "30px",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "color": "#232323",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "DIV": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#e68c07",
              "font-size": "48px",
              "font-family": "'Oswald', sans-serif",
              "googleLink": "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Oswald:200,300,400,500,600,700"
            },
            "SPAN": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".btn": {
              "font-size": "17px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "msg-box4-149",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "font-size": "20px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title DIV": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title SPAN": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "font-size": "46px"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "title": "<span style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;\">BLOCK SPECIFICATIONS</span>",
          "meta": "ZZ",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-14b",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b>Block: </b></p><ul><li>RHS LS7 Aluminum Tall Deck Block</li><li>Bore Size 4.165\"</li><li>Zero Decked</li><li>Honed with Torque Plates and Pressure Washed</li><li>New Durabond Cam Bearings Installed</li><li>Line Honed</li><li>ARP Main Studs</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Pistons: </b></p><ul><li>Custom Wiseco Forged<br><br></li></ul><p><b>Bearings: </b></p><ul><li>Clevite H-Series Main and Rod Bearings\n</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Lifters:</b> </p><ul><li>Morel Hydraulic Roller</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Gaskets: </b></p><ul><li>Cometic Head Gaskets</li></ul>",
          "text2": "<p><b>Crank: </b></p><ul><li>Callies Billet</li><li>Stroke 4.600”</li><li>Internally Balanced Front and Rear</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Rods: </b></p><ul><li>Callies Ultra Forged Steel H-Beam</li><li>6.125” Length</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Rings: </b></p><ul><li>Custom Wiseco Stainless Steel</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Camshaft: </b></p><ul><li>Comp Cams Hydraulic Roller</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Timing Sets: </b></p><ul><li>Cloyes Billet Hex Adjust Roller</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Oil Delivery: </b></p><ul><li>Melling Select Performance</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "22px",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-14c",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "font-size": "20px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title DIV": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title SPAN": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "font-size": "46px"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "title": "<span style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;\">CYLINDER HEAD SPECIFICATIONS</span>",
          "meta": "ZZ",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-14d",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b>Type: </b></p><ul><li>Mast 305cc LS7 Aluminum CNC Ported</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Intake Valves: </b></p><ul><li>Mast Stainless Steel 2.250”</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Exhaust Valves: </b></p><ul><li>Mast Stainless Steel 1.6”\n</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Head Bolts:</b>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>ARP Performance</li></ul>",
          "text2": "<p><b>Combustion Chamber:&nbsp;</b></p><ul><li>70cc\n</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Flow: </b></p><ul><li>400CFM @ .600” Lift</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Spring Kit: </b></p><ul><li>PAC Racing Polished Double Valve Spring</li><li>Light Weight Tool Steel Retainers and Hardened Locks</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Rocker Arms: </b></p><ul><li>GM Factory 1.7 Ratio</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Pushrods: </b></p><ul><li>Smith Brothers 3/8 .083” Wall Hardened</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "22px",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-14e",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text": "<p>We are able to build your engine to match just about any specs you desire, so if you do not see it just ask us!  Each Golen Engine comes standard with a three year no mileage limit warranty to keep you confident and covered. When you purchase one of our LS HP or Hot Rod Series Street Engines you will receive a full spec sheet listing the exact components your engine was built with. We will also provide you with a complete Set Up Guide as well as full phone tech support to aid you with the installation process. It is mandatory for you to contact Golen Engine Tech Support before starting your engine for the first time and you can reach our Tech Support Line at <a href=\"tel:1-800-591-9171\" class=\"text-warning\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">1-800-591-9171</a> ext 2. Each Golen Engine Performance Street Engine comes standard with a “<b>Three Year no Mileage Limit Warranty</b>” to keep you confident and covered! Feel free to contact us anytime for help choosing the perfect performance engine combination!!</p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-14f",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
