          "media": {
            "image": {
              "width": 1400,
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/ls-turn-key-2.png",
              "link": "",
              "alt": "CHEVY LQ9 408ci 550hp COMPLETE ENGINE",
              "title": "CHEVY LQ9 408ci 550hp COMPLETE ENGINE",
              "active": true
            },
            "video": {
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tq7p44IA-1U",
              "aspectratio": "16:9",
              "autoplay": false,
              "loop": false
            },
            "iconFont": {
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-msg-box4",
              "link": "",
              "size": 250
            }
          },
          "title": "<div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Base Price LQ9 $12,249 / LY6 $12,649</span></div>",
          "text": "<p>This LQ9 crate engine makes max power and torque with a hydraulic cam which\nis very street able but also gives you the sound you are looking for!!<br></p><p><b>Peak Horsepower: </b>550bhp @ 6400 rpm<br><b>Peak Torque:</b> 540lb/ft @ 4800 rpm<br><b>Compression Ratio:</b> 11:1\n<br><b>Operating Range:</b> 2300 – 6300rpm<br><b>Required Fuel:</b> 91+ Octane Pump Gasoline&nbsp;<br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"contact-us.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">Get Started Today</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"https://golenengineservice.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/LQ9-LY6-408ci-550hp.pdf\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\">Download Spec Sheet</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"lq9-408ci-550hp-complete-engine-upgrades.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">Upgrade Options</a> ",
          "_name": "msg-box4",
          "_styles": {
            "H3": {
              "font-size": "30px",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
