          "title": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">CHEVY LS7 427ci 650hp COMPLETE ENGINE</span></p>",
          "meta": "<i>LAMYNES.PL</i>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-159",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_inherit": "msg-box5",
          "_params": {
            "showTitle": true,
            "showText": true,
            "showButtons": true,
            "inverse": true,
            "imageSize": 50,
            "paddingTop": "1",
            "paddingBottom": "0",
            "bgImageRadio": false,
            "bgImage": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/golen-logo-sm.png",
            "parallax": true,
            "bgColorRadio": true,
            "bgColor": "#ffffff",
            "bgVideoRadio": false,
            "bgVideo": {
              "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNCr7NdOJgw"
            },
            "overlay": false,
            "overlayColor": "#fff",
            "overlayOpacity": 0.5
          },
          "media": {
            "image": {
              "width": 1400,
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/ls-turn-key-2.png",
              "link": "",
              "alt": "CHEVY LS7 427ci 650hp COMPLETE ENGINE",
              "title": "CHEVY LS7 427ci 650hp COMPLETE ENGINE",
              "active": true
            },
            "video": {
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tq7p44IA-1U",
              "aspectratio": "16:9",
              "autoplay": false,
              "loop": false
            },
            "iconFont": {
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-msg-box4",
              "link": "",
              "size": 250
            }
          },
          "title": "<div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Base Price Wet Sump $16,299 / Dry Sump Z06 $16,899</span></div>",
          "text": "<p>The LS7 427ci 650hp Complete Engine makes max power and torque with a hydraulic cam which\nis very street able but also gives you the sound you are looking for!!<br></p><p><b>Peak Horsepower: </b>650bhp @ 6700 rpm<br><b>Peak Torque:</b> 600lb/ft @ 5200 rpm<br><b>Compression Ratio:</b> 11.5:1\n<br><b>Operating Range:</b> 2500 – 6700rpm<br><b>Required Fuel:</b> 91+ Octane Pump Gasoline&nbsp;<br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"contact-us.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">Get Started Today</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"https://golenengineservice.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/LS7-427ci-650hp-WS-DS-1.pdf\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\">Download Spec Sheet</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"ls7-427ci-650hp-complete-engine-upgrades.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">Upgrade Options</a> ",
          "_name": "msg-box4",
          "_styles": {
            "H3": {
              "font-size": "30px",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "color": "#232323",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "DIV": {
              "text-align": "center",
