              "font-size": "17px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "msg-box4-15a",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "font-size": "20px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title DIV": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title SPAN": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "font-size": "46px"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "title": "<span style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;\">BLOCK SPECIFICATIONS</span>",
          "meta": "ZZ",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-15c",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b>Block: </b></p><ul><li>New GM LS7 Aluminum Block</li><li>Zero Decked \n</li><li>Bored 4.130” \n</li><li>Honed with Torque Plates and Pressure Washed \n</li><li>New Durabond Cam Bearings Installed \n</li><li>Line Honed \n</li><li>ARP Main Studs</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Pistons: </b></p><ul><li>Mahle Forged pistons with Anti-Friction Coating<br><br></li></ul><p><b>Bearings: </b></p><ul><li>Clevite  H-Series Main and Rod Bearings</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Lifters:</b> </p><ul><li>Comp Cams Hydraulic Roller</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Covers: </b></p><ul><li>GM Oil Pan (Camaro, Corvette, GTO or Truck)</li><li>GM Timing Cover \n</li><li>GM Rear Cover \n</li><li>GM Lifter Valley Cover \n</li><li>GM Valve Covers</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Damper:</b></p><ul><li>Powerbond SFI</li><li>ARP Damper Bolt</li></ul><p><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>Crank: </b></p><ul><li>Callies Comp Star 4340 Forged Steel \n</li><li>4.000” stroke \n</li><li>Internally Balanced Front and Rear</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Rods: </b></p><ul><li>Callies Comp Star Forged Steel H-Beam</li><li>6.125” Length</li><li>ARP 2000 Rod Bolts</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Rings: </b></p><ul><li>Mahle Plasma Moly</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Camshaft: </b></p><ul><li>Comp Cams Hydraulic Roller</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Timing Sets: </b></p><ul><li>Cloyes Billet Roller Hex Adjust 4X</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Oil Delivery: </b></p><ul><li>Katech Performance Dry Sump or Melling Wet Sump</li><li>GM Pick Up Tube \n</li><li>GM Windage Tray</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Gaskets:\n</b></p><ul><li>GM MLS Head Gaskets .050”</li><li>GM Cover Gaskets</li></ul>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "22px",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-15d",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "font-size": "20px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title DIV": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title SPAN": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "font-size": "46px"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "title": "<span style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;\">CYLINDER HEAD SPECIFICATIONS</span>",
          "meta": "ZZ",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-15e",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b>Type: </b></p><ul><li>Trick Flow LS7 Aluminum CNC Ported</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Intake Valves: </b></p><ul><li>Stainless Steel 2.20”\n</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Exhaust Valves: </b></p><ul><li>Stainless Steel 1.65”</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Head Bolts:</b>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>ARP Performance</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Intake System: \n</b></p><ul><li>GM Factory LS7 Intake \n</li><li>90mm Throttle Body DBW</li><li>Fast 40lb Uscar Fuel Injectors</li><li>GM Factory Fuel Rails</li></ul>",
          "text2": "<p><b>Combustion Chamber: \n</b></p><ul><li>70cc \n</li></ul><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Flow: \n</b></p><ul><li>365CFM @ .650” Lift</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Spring Kit: \n</b></p><ul><li>Polished Double Valve Spring \n</li><li>Titanium Retainers and Hardened Locks</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Rocker Arms: \n</b></p><ul><li>GM Factory 1.8 Ratio \n</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Pushrods: \n</b></p><ul><li>Smith Brothers 3/8 .083” Wall Hardened</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Ignition System: \n</b></p><ul><li>MSD 8.5mm Plug  Wires \n</li><li>Autolite Racing Spark Plugs</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Dyno Test Service: \n</b></p><ul><li>Run Engine for Full Break In and Power Test \n</li><li>2 Oil Changes using Joe Gibbs Break In Oil \n</li><li>Graphs Listing HP, Torque and all Engine Vitals \n</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b><br></b></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "22px",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-15f",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text": "<p>We are able to build your engine to match just about any specs you desire, so if you do not see it just ask us!  Each Golen Engine comes standard with a three year no mileage limit warranty to keep you confident and covered. When you purchase one of our LS HP or Hot Rod Series Street Engines you will receive a full spec sheet listing the exact components your engine was built with. We will also provide you with a complete Set Up Guide as well as full phone tech support to aid you with the installation process. It is mandatory for you to contact Golen Engine Tech Support before starting your engine for the first time and you can reach our Tech Support Line at <a href=\"tel:1-800-591-9171\" class=\"text-warning\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">1-800-591-9171</a> ext 2. Each Golen Engine Performance Street Engine comes standard with a “<b>Three Year no Mileage Limit Warranty</b>” to keep you confident and covered! Feel free to contact us anytime for help choosing the perfect performance engine combination!!</p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-15g",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
