              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/lsx-427ci-725hp-complete-sm-1.png",
              "link": "",
              "alt": "CHEVY RHS LS7 502ci 800hp COMPLETE ENGINE",
              "title": "CHEVY RHS LS7 502ci 800hp COMPLETE ENGINE",
              "active": true
            },
            "video": {
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tq7p44IA-1U",
              "aspectratio": "16:9",
              "autoplay": false,
              "loop": false
            },
            "iconFont": {
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-msg-box4",
              "link": "",
              "size": 250
            }
          },
          "title": "<div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Call <a href=\"tel:1-800-591-9171 \" class=\"text-warning\">1-800-591-9171</a> for Custom Pricing</span></div>",
          "text": "<p>The 502ci makes max power and torque with a hydraulic cam which\nis very street able but also gives you the sound you are looking for!!<br></p><p><b>Peak Horsepower:</b> 800bhp @ 6700 rpm<br><b>Peak Torque:</b> 680lb/ft @ 5200 rpm<br><b>Compression Ratio:</b> 11.5:1<br><b>Operating Range:</b> 3000 – 6700rpm<br><b>Required Fuel:</b> 91+ Octane Pump Gasoline<br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"contact-us.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">Get Started Today</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"https://golenengineservice.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/RHS-502ci-800hp-1.pdf\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\">Download Spec Sheet</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"rhs-ls7-502ci-800hp-complete-engine-upgrades.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">Upgrade Options</a> ",
          "_name": "msg-box4",
          "_styles": {
            "H3": {
              "font-size": "30px",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "color": "#232323",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "DIV": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#e68c07",
              "font-size": "48px",
              "font-family": "'Oswald', sans-serif",
              "googleLink": "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Oswald:200,300,400,500,600,700"
            },
            "SPAN": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".btn": {
              "font-size": "17px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "msg-box4-16a",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "font-size": "20px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title DIV": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title SPAN": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "font-size": "46px"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "title": "<span style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;\">BLOCK SPECIFICATIONS</span>",
          "meta": "ZZ",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-16c",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b>Block: </b></p><ul><li>New RHS Aluminum Race Block</li><li>Zero Decked \n</li><li>Bored 4.165” \n</li><li>Honed with Torque Plates and Pressure Washed \n</li><li>New Durabond Cam Bearings Installed \n</li><li>Line Honed \n</li><li>ARP Main Studs</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Pistons: </b></p><ul><li>Wiseco Custom Forged pistons with Anti-Friction Coating<br><br></li></ul><p><b>Bearings: </b></p><ul><li>Clevite H-Series Main and Rod Bearings</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Lifters:</b> </p><ul><li>Morel Hydraulic Roller Tie Bar</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Covers: </b></p><ul><li>Proper Pan For Chassis</li><li>GM Timing Cover \n</li><li>GM Rear Cover \n</li><li>GM Lifter Valley Cover \n</li><li>GM Valve Covers</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Damper:</b></p><ul><li>Powerbond SFI</li><li>ARP Damper Bolt</li></ul><p><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>Crank: </b></p><ul><li>Callies Billet Series</li><li>4.500” stroke \n</li><li>Internally Balanced Front and Rear</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Rods: </b></p><ul><li>Callies 4340 Ultra Forged H-Beam</li><li>6.350” Length</li><li>ARP 2000 Rod Bolts</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Rings: </b></p><ul><li>Stainless Steel Ring Set</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Camshaft: </b></p><ul><li>Comp Cams Custom Hydraulic Roller\n</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Timing Sets: </b></p><ul><li>Cloyes Billet Roller Hex Adjust 4X</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Oil Delivery: </b></p><ul><li>Melling HV Oil Pump</li><li>GM Pick Up Tube \n</li><li>GM Windage Tray</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Gaskets:\n</b></p><ul><li>GM MLS Head Gaskets .050”</li><li>GM Cover Gaskets</li></ul>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "22px",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-16d",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "font-size": "20px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title DIV": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title SPAN": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "font-size": "46px"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "title": "<span style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;\">CYLINDER HEAD SPECIFICATIONS</span>",
          "meta": "ZZ",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-16e",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b>Type: </b></p><ul><li>Mast 320cc LS7 Aluminum CNC Ported</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Intake Valves: </b></p><ul><li>Stainless Steel 2.250”</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Exhaust Valves: </b></p><ul><li>Stainless Steel 1.6”</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Head Bolts:</b>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>ARP Performance</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Intake System: \n</b></p><ul><li>Custom Intake System based on Power Level</li></ul>",
          "text2": "<p><b>Combustion Chamber: \n</b></p><ul><li>70cc \n</li></ul><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Flow: \n</b></p><ul><li>420CFM @ .650” Lift</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Spring Kit: \n</b></p><ul><li>Polished Double Valve Spring</li><li>Titanium Retainers and Hardened Locks</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Rocker Arms: \n</b></p><ul><li>GM Factory 1.8 Ratio, Comp Cam Trunion Kit</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Pushrods: \n</b></p><ul><li>Smith Brothers 3/8 .083” Wall Hardened</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Ignition System: \n</b></p><ul><li>MSD 8.5mm Plug  Wires \n</li><li>Autolite Racing Spark Plugs</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Dyno Test Service: \n</b></p><ul><li>Run Engine for Full Break In and Power Test \n</li><li>2 Oil Changes using Joe Gibbs Break In Oil \n</li><li>Graphs Listing HP, Torque and all Engine Vitals \n</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b><br></b></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "22px",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-16f",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text": "<p>We are able to build your engine to match just about any specs you desire, so if you do not see it just ask us!  Each Golen Engine comes standard with a three year no mileage limit warranty to keep you confident and covered. When you purchase one of our LS HP or Hot Rod Series Street Engines you will receive a full spec sheet listing the exact components your engine was built with. We will also provide you with a complete Set Up Guide as well as full phone tech support to aid you with the installation process. It is mandatory for you to contact Golen Engine Tech Support before starting your engine for the first time and you can reach our Tech Support Line at <a href=\"tel:1-800-591-9171\" class=\"text-warning\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">1-800-591-9171</a> ext 2. Each Golen Engine Performance Street Engine comes standard with a “<b>Three Year no Mileage Limit Warranty</b>” to keep you confident and covered! Feel free to contact us anytime for help choosing the perfect performance engine combination!!</p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-16g",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
