          },
          "media": {
            "image": {
              "width": 1400,
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/lsx-427ci-725hp-complete-sm-1.png",
              "link": "",
              "alt": "CHEVY RHS 427ci BOOSTED COMPLETE ENGINE",
              "title": "CHEVY RHS 427ci BOOSTED COMPLETE ENGINE",
              "active": true
            },
            "video": {
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tq7p44IA-1U",
              "aspectratio": "16:9",
              "autoplay": false,
              "loop": false
            },
            "iconFont": {
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-msg-box4",
              "link": "",
              "size": 250
            }
          },
          "title": "<div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Call <a href=\"tel:1-800-591-9171 \" class=\"text-warning\">1-800-591-9171</a> for Custom Pricing</span></div>",
          "text": "<p>The 427ci RHS Boosted engine was built for customers that are looking to run\n20-30 psi of boost and 1000hp +<br></p><p><b>Compression Ratio:</b> 9.5:1<br><b>Operating Range:</b> 2500 – 6700rpm<br><b>Required Fuel:</b> 91+ Octane Pump Gasoline<br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"contact-us.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">Get Started Today</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"https://golenengineservice.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/RHS-427ci-Boosted.pdf\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\">Download Spec Sheet</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"rhs-427ci-boosted-complete-engine-upgrades.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">Upgrade Options</a> ",
          "_name": "msg-box4",
          "_styles": {
            "H3": {
              "font-size": "30px",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "color": "#232323",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "DIV": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#e68c07",
              "font-size": "48px",
              "font-family": "'Oswald', sans-serif",
              "googleLink": "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Oswald:200,300,400,500,600,700"
            },
            "SPAN": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".btn": {
              "font-size": "17px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "msg-box4-16j",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "font-size": "20px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title DIV": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title SPAN": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "font-size": "46px"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "title": "<span style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;\">BLOCK SPECIFICATIONS</span>",
          "meta": "ZZ",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-16l",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b>Block: </b></p><ul><li>RHS Aluminum Block</li><li>Zero Decked \n</li><li>Bored 4.125” \n</li><li>Honed with Torque Plates and Pressure Washed \n</li><li>New Durabond Cam Bearings Installed \n</li><li>Line Honed \n</li><li>ARP Main Studs</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Pistons: </b></p><ul><li>Wiseco Forged Pistons, tool steel wrist pins<br><br></li></ul><p><b>Bearings: </b></p><ul><li>Clevite H-Series Main and Rod Bearings</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Lifters:</b> </p><ul><li>Morel Hydraulic Roller</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Covers: </b></p><ul><li>GM Oil Pan (Corvette, Camaro, GTO or Truck)</li><li>GM Timing Cover \n</li><li>GM Rear Cover \n</li><li>GM Lifter Valley Cover \n</li><li>GM Valve Covers</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Damper:</b></p><ul><li>Powerbond SFI</li><li>ARP Damper Bolt</li></ul><p><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>Crank: </b></p><ul><li>Callies Dragon Slayer 4340 Forged Steel\n</li><li>4.000” stroke \n</li><li>Internally Balanced Front and Rear</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Rods: </b></p><ul><li>Callies 4340 Ultra Forged I-Beam</li><li>6.125” Length</li><li>ARP 2000 Rod Bolts</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Rings: </b></p><ul><li>Stainless Steel Rings Gapped for Boost</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Camshaft: </b></p><ul><li>Comp Cams Hydraulic Roller</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Timing Sets: </b></p><ul><li>Cloyes Billet Roller Hex Adjust Z-Chain</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Oil Delivery: </b></p><ul><li>Melling Performance</li><li>GM Pick Up Tube \n</li><li>GM Windage Tray</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Gaskets:\n</b></p><ul><li>GM MLS Head Gaskets .051”</li><li>GM Cover Gaskets</li></ul>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "22px",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-16m",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "font-size": "20px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title DIV": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title SPAN": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "font-size": "46px"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "title": "<span style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;\">CYLINDER HEAD SPECIFICATIONS</span>",
          "meta": "ZZ",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-16n",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b>Type: </b></p><ul><li>Trick Fow LS7 Aluminum CNC Ported 6-Bolt</li><li>Three angle performance valve job</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Intake Valves: </b></p><ul><li>Stainless Steel 2.20”</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Exhaust Valves: </b></p><ul><li>Extreme Duty Inconel Stainless Steel 1.6”</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Head Bolts:</b>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>ARP Performance Heads Studs 6-bolt&nbsp;</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Intake System: \n</b></p><ul><li>Fast LSxR 102mm LS7 Intake</li><li>102mm Nick Williams Billet Throttle Body</li><li>80-120lb Uscar Fuel Injectors</li></ul>",
          "text2": "<p><b>Combustion Chamber: \n</b></p><ul><li>70cc \n</li></ul><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Flow: \n</b></p><ul><li>365CFM @ .650” Lift</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Spring Kit: \n</b></p><ul><li>Polished Double Valve Spring</li><li>Titanium Retainers and Hardened Locks</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Rocker Arms: \n</b></p><ul><li>GM Factory 1.8 Ratio, Comp Cam Trunion Upgrade</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Pushrods: \n</b></p><ul><li>Smith Brothers 3/8 .083” Wall Hardened</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Ignition System: \n</b></p><ul><li>MSD 8.5mm Plug  Wires \n</li><li>Autolite Racing Spark Plugs</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Dyno Test Service: \n</b></p><ul><li>Run Engine for Full Break In and Power Test \n</li><li>2 Oil Changes using Joe Gibbs Break In Oil \n</li><li>Graphs Listing HP, Torque and all Engine Vitals \n</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b><br></b></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "22px",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-16o",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text": "<p>We are able to build your engine to match just about any specs you desire, so if you do not see it just ask us!  Each Golen Engine comes standard with a three year no mileage limit warranty to keep you confident and covered. When you purchase one of our LS HP or Hot Rod Series Street Engines you will receive a full spec sheet listing the exact components your engine was built with. We will also provide you with a complete Set Up Guide as well as full phone tech support to aid you with the installation process. It is mandatory for you to contact Golen Engine Tech Support before starting your engine for the first time and you can reach our Tech Support Line at <a href=\"tel:1-800-591-9171\" class=\"text-warning\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">1-800-591-9171</a> ext 2. Each Golen Engine Performance Street Engine comes standard with a “<b>Three Year no Mileage Limit Warranty</b>” to keep you confident and covered! Feel free to contact us anytime for help choosing the perfect performance engine combination!!</p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-16p",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
