          "title": "<div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Base Price $4,299</span></div>",
          "text": "<p>The 5.7L Street Strip short block uses a new GM LS6 block with 3.905\" bore to produce the 346CI.<br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"contact-us.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">Get Started Today</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"https://golenengineservice.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/5.7L-LS1-LS6-Street-Strip-Short-Block.pdf\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\">Download Spec Sheet</a>",
          "_name": "msg-box4",
          "_styles": {
