          "title": "<div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Base Price LY6 $5,199 / LQ9 $4,699</span></div>",
          "text": "<p>The LQ9 408ci Boosted Competition short block uses a new GM LQ9 cast\niron block with 4.030\" bore to produce the large 408ci.<br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"contact-us.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">Get Started Today</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"https://golenengineservice.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/408-LQ9-Boosted-SB-web.pdf\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\">Download Spec Sheet</a>",
          "_name": "msg-box4",
          "_styles": {
