          "title": "<div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Base Price $7,499</span></div>",
          "text": "The LS7 427ci competition short block uses a new GM LS7 blockwith 4.130\" bore to produce the 427CI.",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"contact-us.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">Get Started Today</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"https://golenengineservice.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/427-LS7-Boosted-SB-Web.pdf\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\">Download Spec Sheet</a>",
