          "title": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Jeep 4.6L 270 HP EFI Turnkey Engine</span></p>",
          "meta": "<i>LAMYNES.PL</i>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-1ac",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_inherit": "msg-box5",
          "_params": {
            "showTitle": true,
            "showText": true,
            "showButtons": true,
            "inverse": true,
            "imageSize": 50,
            "paddingTop": "1",
            "paddingBottom": "0",
            "bgImageRadio": false,
            "bgImage": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/golen-logo-sm.png",
            "parallax": true,
            "bgColorRadio": true,
            "bgColor": "#ffffff",
            "bgVideoRadio": false,
            "bgVideo": {
              "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNCr7NdOJgw"
            },
            "overlay": false,
            "overlayColor": "#fff",
            "overlayOpacity": 0.5
          },
          "media": {
            "image": {
              "width": 1400,
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/jeep-stroker-cj-efi-turn-key-2.png",
              "link": "",
              "alt": "Jeep 4.6L 270 HP EFI Turnkey Engine",
              "title": "Jeep 4.6L 270 HP EFI Turnkey Engine",
              "active": true
            },
            "video": {
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tq7p44IA-1U",
              "aspectratio": "16:9",
              "autoplay": false,
              "loop": false
            },
            "iconFont": {
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-msg-box4",
              "link": "",
              "size": 250
            }
          },
          "title": "<div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">1971-1990 Year Models $8,529</span></div>",
          "text": "<p>The Jeep 4.6L makes great power right off idle and produces 300 ft lbs of\n<br>torque that will help your Jeep up those steep grades with ease. This engine\n<br>loves both on and off road and gets good fuel economy as well.&nbsp;<br></p><p><b>Peak Horsepower:&nbsp;</b>270hp<br><b>Peak Torque:&nbsp;</b>300 ft lbs +<br><b>Compression Ratio:&nbsp;</b>9.5:1<br><b>Operating Range:&nbsp;</b>Idle to 5200 rpm<br><b>Required Fuel:</b> 89 Octane +<br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"contact-us.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">Get Started Today</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"https://golenengineservice.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/JEEP 4.6L 270 HP EFI TURNKEY ENGINE Spec Sheet.pdf\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\">Download Spec Sheet</a> ",
          "_name": "msg-box4",
          "_styles": {
            "H3": {
              "font-size": "30px",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "color": "#232323",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "DIV": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#e68c07",
              "font-size": "48px",
              "font-family": "'Oswald', sans-serif",
              "googleLink": "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Oswald:200,300,400,500,600,700"
            },
            "SPAN": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".btn": {
              "font-size": "17px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "msg-box4-1ad",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "font-size": "20px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title DIV": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title SPAN": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "font-size": "46px"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "title": "<span style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;\">BLOCK SPECIFICATIONS</span>",
          "meta": "ZZ",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-1af",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b>Block: </b></p><ul><li>Factory Cast Iron Block, Oven cleaned, blasted, mag, bore and performance\n hone cylinders to 3.905\", Deck block, line hone mainline and set main bearing clearance, Durabond cam bearings and brass freeze plugs</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Pistons: </b></p><ul><li>Sealed Power Hypereutectic Pistons with coated skirts<br><br></li></ul><p><b>Bearings: </b></p><ul><li>Clevite Main and rod bearings\n</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Lifters:</b> </p><ul><li>Comp Cams Hyd Flat</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Oil Delivery:</b></p><ul><li>Melling Std volume oil pump with new pick up screen</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Crank:</b></p><ul><li>Callies cast steel performance crankshaft, dynamic balance</li></ul><p><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>Rods:</b><br></p><ul><li>Aftermarket forged steel connecting rods, machined in house and bearing\n clearances set, balanced</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Rings: </b></p><ul><li>Hastings Plasma Moly Rings</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Camshaft: </b></p><ul><li>Comp Cams Custom Hyd Flat\n</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Timing Sets: </b></p><ul><li>Cloyes Single Roller\n</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Gaskets:</b><br></p><ul><li>Fel Pro Master Gasket Kit\n</li></ul>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "22px",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-1ag",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "font-size": "20px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title DIV": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title SPAN": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "font-size": "46px"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "title": "<span style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;\">CYLINDER HEAD SPECIFICATIONS</span>",
          "meta": "ZZ",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-1ah",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b>Type: </b></p><ul><li>1991-1999 Casting # 7120 head/2000-2006 New Aftermarket Casting: New valve guides installed, three angle performance valve job, head decked, cut for Viton Valve Seals&nbsp;</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Intake Valves: </b></p><ul><li>SBI Factory 1.91\" Intake Valves</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Head Bolts:</b>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Grade 10 Head Bolts</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Push Rods:\n</b></p><ul><li>SBI Factory</li></ul><p><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>Combustion Chamber:</b><br></p><ul><li>62cc\n \n</li></ul><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Exhuast Valves: \n</b></p><ul><li>SBI Factory 1.5\"</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Vavle Springs: \n</b></p><ul><li>Comp Cams performance valve springs and hardened retainers</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Rocker Arms: \n</b></p><ul><li>Sealed Power Factory</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b><br></b></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "22px",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-1ai",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "font-size": "20px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title DIV": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title SPAN": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "font-size": "46px"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "1",
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "title": "<span style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;\">ADDITIONAL SPECIFICATIONS</span>",
          "meta": "ZZ",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-1aj",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b>Covers:\n</b></p><ul><li>New oil pan, timing cover, valve cover with Golen Engine 4.6L Jeep\n</li><li>Stroker Sticker with PCV and Breather\n</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Harmonic Balancer:\n</b></p><ul><li>New Factory damper to match your engines accessories</li></ul><p><br></p><p>\n</p><p><b>Intake System:\n</b></p><ul><li>Performance intake manifold, Holley Sniper 2bbl EFI System complete  with inline fuel pump kit</li></ul><p><br></p><p>\n</p><p><b>Ignition System:\n</b></p><ul><li>Holley Sniper EFI Ignition</li></ul><p><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>Exhuast System:</b></p><ul><li>JBA Stainless Steel header</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Water Pump:\n</b></p><ul><li>Flow Kooler High Flow</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Tune Up Parts:\n</b></p><ul><li>Joe Gibbs Racing Break In Oil, Wix oil filter # 1085 and Champion Spark\n Plugs #430</li></ul><p>\n</p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "22px",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-1ak",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text": "<p>Here are Golen Engine we build each Jeep engine with the same meticulous process used in our line of racing engines to ensure top quality\n</p><p>performance and reliability throughout its lifetime.\n</p><p><br></p><p>When you purchase one of our Jeep High Performance Street Engines you will receive a full spec sheet listing the exact components your engine was\n</p><p>built with. We will also provide you with a complete Setup Guide as well as full phone tech support to aid you with the installation process. It is mandatory\n</p><p>for you to contact Golen Engine Tech Support before starting your engine for the first time and you can reach our Tech Support Line​ at 1-800-591-9171\n</p><p>ext 2.\n</p><p><br></p><p>Each Golen Engine Performance Street Engine comes standard with a “<b>Three Year no Mileage Limit Warranty</b>” to keep you confident and covered! Feel\n</p><p>free to contact us anytime for help choosing the perfect performance engine combination!!\n&nbsp;</p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-1al",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
