          "media": {
            "image": {
              "width": 1400,
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/jeep-4.6l-270-hp-complete-sm-1.png",
              "link": "",
              "alt": "4.6L 270hp Jeep Complete Stroker Engine",
              "title": "4.6L 270hp Jeep Complete Stroker Engine",
              "active": true
            },
            "video": {
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tq7p44IA-1U",
              "aspectratio": "16:9",
              "autoplay": false,
              "loop": false
            },
            "iconFont": {
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-msg-box4",
              "link": "",
              "size": 250
            }
          },
          "title": "<div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">1991-1999 Year Models $5,849\n<br></span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">2000-2006 Year Models $6,249</span></div>",
          "text": "<p>The Jeep 4.6L makes great power right off idle and produces 300 ft lbs of\n<br>torque that will help your Jeep up those steep grades with ease. This\n<br>engine loves both on and off road and gets good fuel economy as well.&nbsp;<br></p><p><b>Peak Horsepower:&nbsp;</b>270hp<br><b>Peak Torque:&nbsp;</b>300 ft lbs +<br><b>Compression Ratio:&nbsp;</b>9.5:1<br><b>Operating Range:&nbsp;</b>Idle to 5200 rpm<br><b>Required Fuel:</b> 89 Octane +<br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"contact-us.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">Get Started Today</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"https://golenengineservice.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/4.6L 270hp Jeep Complete Stroker Engine Spec Sheet.pdf\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\">Download Spec Sheet</a> ",
          "_name": "msg-box4",
          "_styles": {
            "H3": {
              "font-size": "30px",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "color": "#232323",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "DIV": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#e68c07",
              "font-size": "48px",
