              "color": "#232323",
              "font-size": "46px"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "title": "<span style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;\">CYLINDER HEAD SPECIFICATIONS</span>",
          "meta": "ZZ",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-1a6",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b>Type: </b></p><ul><li>1991-1999 Casting # 7120 head/2000-2006 New Aftermarket Casting: New valve guides installed, three angle performance valve job, head decked, cut for Viton Valve Seals&nbsp;</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Intake Valves: </b></p><ul><li>SBI Factory 1.91\" Intake Valves</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Head Bolts:</b>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Grade 10 Head Bolts</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Push Rods:\n</b></p><ul><li>SBI Factory</li></ul><p><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>Combustion Chamber:</b><br></p><ul><li>62cc\n \n</li></ul><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Exhuast Valves: \n</b></p><ul><li>SBI Factory 1.5\"</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Vavle Springs: \n</b></p><ul><li>Comp Cams performance valve springs and hardened retainers</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b>Rocker Arms: \n</b></p><ul><li>Sealed Power Factory</li></ul><p><b>&nbsp;\n</b></p><p><b><br></b></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "22px",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-1a7",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "font-size": "20px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title DIV": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title SPAN": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "font-size": "46px"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "1",
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "title": "<span style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;\">ADDITIONAL SPECIFICATIONS</span>",
          "meta": "ZZ",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-1aa",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b>Covers:\n</b></p><ul><li>New oil pan, timing cover, valve cover with Golen Engine 4.6L Jeep&nbsp;Stroker Sticker</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Harmonic Balancer:\n</b></p><ul><li>New Factory damper to match your engines accessories\n</li></ul><p><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>Fuel Injectors:\n</b></p><ul><li>New Bosch 24 lb (direct fit for your year Jeep)</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Tune Up Parts:\n</b></p><ul><li>Joe Gibbs Racing Break In Oil, Wix oil filter # 1085 and Champion</li></ul><p><b><br></b></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "22px",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-1ab",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text": "<p>Here are Golen Engine we build each Jeep engine with the same meticulous process used in our line of racing engines to ensure top quality\n</p><p>performance and reliability throughout its lifetime.</p><p><br></p><p>\n</p><p>\n</p><p>When you purchase one of our Jeep High Performance Street Engines you will receive a full spec sheet listing the exact components your engine was\n</p><p>built with. We will also provide you with a complete Setup Guide as well as full phone tech support to aid you with the installation process. It is mandatory\n</p><p>for you to contact Golen Engine Tech Support before starting your engine for the first time and you can reach our Tech Support Line​ at 1-800-591-9171\n</p><p>ext 2.</p><p><br></p><p>\n</p><p>\n</p><p>Each Golen Engine Performance Street Engine comes standard with a “<b>Three Year no Mileage Limit Warranty</b>” to keep you confident and covered! Feel\n</p><p>free to contact us anytime for help choosing the perfect performance engine combination!!</p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-1a8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
