              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "title": "LS2 402ci 550hp Complete Engine Upgrades",
          "meta": "By John Smith posted July 20, 2016",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-1cj",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<p>Our 402ci LS2 has a strong sounding idle with good street manners and makes 550hp which is sure to burn the tire!!. We have found some real nice gains by installing aftermarket intakes such as the Fast 102mm or the Holley Hi Ram. Using good performance long tube header that has 1 7/8” primary tubes and a 3.5” collector is recommend. This engine works best with a 3000 rpm stall or any manual transmission and a 3.73 gear or lower, you can check out our offerings from RPM Transmission below.</p><p><br></p><p>We offer full customization on all of our Chevy LS1 Engines so if you are looking for any internal changes or external add-ons just ask!!</p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-1ch",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
