        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, p": {
              "color": "#fff"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "font-size": "60px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title SPAN": {
              "font-size": "60px"
            },
            ".lead P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showTitle": true,
            "showText": true,
            "showButton": false,
            "paddingTop": "3",
            "paddingBottom": "1",
            "bgImageRadio": true,
            "bgImage": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/402-550hp-3.jpg",
            "parallax": true,
            "bgColorRadio": false,
            "bgColor": "#F2F2F2",
            "bgVideoRadio": false,
            "bgVideo": {
              "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNCr7NdOJgw"
            },
            "overlay": true,
            "overlayColor": "#000000",
            "overlayOpacity": "0.4"
          },
          "title": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><i>From a C6 Corvette to </i></span><br><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><i>a </i></span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><i>1st Gen Camaro\n</i></span>",
          "text": "<p>Our entire line of Chevy LS engines can be custom built to be a direct bolt in for any vehicle so weather you have a GM car that came from the factory with a LS based engine or you have a early hot rod that you would like to retro fit we have you covered. Check out the options below  and keep in mind that we offer full engine custom builds so if you do not see what you are looking for just ask.</p>",
          "button": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\">SEE ALL TEMPLATES</a>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "msg-box8",
          "_anchor": "msg-box8-1d2",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "font-size": "46px",
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "title": "LS3 416ci 605hp Complete Engine Upgrades",
          "meta": "By John Smith posted July 20, 2016",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-1d4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<p>Our 416ci LS3 is one of our best sellers for sure, making 605hp it is super powerful but still has good street manners overall. We have seen gains up to 635hp with aftermarket Trick Flow CNC ported heads and a Fast LSxR 102mm Intake. Using good performance long tube header that has 1 7/8” primary tubes and a 3.5” collector is recommend. This engine works best with a 3000 rpm stall or any manual transmission and a 3.73 gear or lower, you can check out our offerings from RPM Transmission below.</p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-1d5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
