          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "title": "LSx 454ci 700hp Complete Engine Upgrades",
          "meta": "By John Smith posted July 20, 2016",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-1ed",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<p>Our 454ci Lsx is the King of the street when it comes to tire shredding torque!! This engine has a rough idle with a redline of 7000 rpm and loves being run hard on a daily basis making 700hp plus. Using good performance long tube header that has 1 7/8” primary tubes and a 3.5” collector is recommend. This engine works best with a 3500 rpm stall or any manual transmission and a 3.73 gear or lower, you can check out our offerings from RPM Transmission below.</p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
