          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "title": "RHS 427ci Boosted Complete Engine Upgrades",
          "meta": "By John Smith posted July 20, 2016",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-1fm",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "text": "<p>Our 427ci RHS Boosted Engine can be set up to run either a turbo or super charger with a max of 1400hp. It has a super strong lower engine featuring a Callies Dragon Slayer crank and Ultra H-Beam rods and a Wiseco boost ready piston. We can custom build this engine to meet your power goals and we offer super charger kits from Whipple and ATI Procharger. If you need recommendations for fuel system and tuning we can help and offer Holley EFI kits that work great with this level of power.</p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-1fn",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
