          },
          "title": "<div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Base Price $3,299</span></div>",
          "text": "<p>The 383 Street/Strip Short Block is a good foundation for performance\n<br>engines builds up to 500hp<br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"contact-us.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">Get Started Today</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"https://golenengineservice.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/383-LT1-SS-SB-Web.pdf\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\">Download Spec Sheet</a> ",
          "_name": "msg-box4",
          "_styles": {
            "H3": {
              "font-size": "30px",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "color": "#232323",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "DIV": {
