          "_anchor": "msg-box4-1h3",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "font-size": "20px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title DIV": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title SPAN": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "font-size": "46px"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "title": "<span style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;\">ENGINE SPECIFICATIONS</span>",
          "meta": "The 5.3L factory short block uses a new GM LS1 block with 3.780\" bore to produce the 327CI.",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-1h5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b>Block:&nbsp;</b></p><ul><li>GM LT1 Cast Iron Block \n</li><li>Deck to Match Pistons \n</li><li>Bored 4.030” \n</li><li>Honed with Torque Plates and Pressure Washed \n</li><li>New Durabond Cam Bearings Installed \n</li><li>4Bolt Main Caps Installed, Line Bore and Hone \n</li><li>ARP Main Studs</li></ul><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Pistons:&nbsp;</b></p><ul><li>Mahle Forged pistons with AntiFriction Coating</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Bearings:&nbsp;</b><br></p><ul><li>Clevite HSeries Main and Rod Bearings&nbsp;</li></ul><p><b><br></b></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>Crank:&nbsp;</b></p><ul><li>Scat  4340 Forged Steel \n</li><li>3.750” stroke \n</li><li>Internally Balanced Front and External Balance Rear</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Rods:&nbsp;</b></p><ul><li>Scat 4340 Forged HBeam \n</li><li>6.000” length \n</li><li>ARP  Rod Bolts</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Rings:</b></p><ul><li>Mahle Plasma rings</li></ul><p><br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "22px",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-1h6",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text": "<p>Here at Golen Engine we build each LT1 Street engine with the same meticulous process used in our line of racing engines to ensure top quality performance and reliability throughout its lifetime.  \n</p><p><br></p><p>When you purchase one of our LT1 High Performance Street Engines you will receive a full spec sheet listing the exact components your engine was built with. We will also provide you with a complete Set Up Guide as well as full phone tech support \nto aid you with the installation process. It is mandatory for you to contact Golen Engine Tech Support before starting your engine for the first time and you can reach our Tech Support Line at <a href=\"tel:1-800-591-9171\" class=\"text-warning\">1-800-591-9171</a> ext 2. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Each Golen Engine Performance Street Engine comes standard with a “<b>Three Year no Mileage Limit Warranty</b>” to keep you confident and covered! \n</p><p>We are able to custom build your engine to match just about any specs you desire and offer a long list of proven upgrades, so if you do not see it just ask us!</p><p><br></p><p> \n</p><p>Feel free to contact us anytime for help choosing the perfect performance engine combination!! \n</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you,  \n</p><p>Golen Engine</p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-1h7",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "3",
            "paddingBottom": "3",
