          "media": {
            "image": {
              "width": 1400,
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/lt1-short-block-2.png",
              "link": "",
              "alt": " 383ci 440hp LT1 Long Block Engine",
              "title": " 383ci 440hp LT1 Long Block Engine",
              "active": true
            },
            "video": {
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tq7p44IA-1U",
              "aspectratio": "16:9",
              "autoplay": false,
              "loop": false
            },
            "iconFont": {
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-msg-box4",
              "link": "",
              "size": 250
            }
          },
          "title": "<div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Base Price $6,799</span></div>",
          "text": "<p>The 383/440 LT1 is an excellent performing engine package designed\n<br>for the LT1 Camaro and Firebird that won’t break the bank.<br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><b>Peak Horsepower:</b>&nbsp;</span>440bhp @ 6300rpm<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><b>Peak Torque:</b>&nbsp;</span>460lb/ft @ 4000rpm<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><b>Compression Ratio:</b>&nbsp;</span>11.5:1<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><b>Operating Range:</b>&nbsp;</span>1800 – 6300rpm<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><b>Required Fuel:</b> 91+ Octane Pump Gasoline</span></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"contact-us.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">Get Started Today</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"https://golenengineservice.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/383-440hp-LT1-LB.pdf\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\">Download Spec Sheet</a> ",
          "_name": "msg-box4",
          "_styles": {
            "H3": {
              "font-size": "30px",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px",
              "color": "#232323",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "DIV": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#e68c07",
              "font-size": "48px",
              "font-family": "'Oswald', sans-serif",
              "googleLink": "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Oswald:200,300,400,500,600,700"
            },
            "SPAN": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".btn": {
              "font-size": "17px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "msg-box4-1hy",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "font-size": "20px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title DIV": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title SPAN": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "font-size": "46px"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "title": "<span style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;\">BLOCK SPECIFICATIONS</span>",
          "meta": "ZZ",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-1i0",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b>Block: </b></p><ul><li>GM LT1 Cast Iron Block \n</li><li>Decked to Match Pistons \n</li><li>Bored 4.030” \n</li><li>Honed with Torque Plates and Pressure Washed \n</li><li>New Durabond Cam Bearings Installed \n</li><li>4Bolt Main Caps Installed, Line Bore and Hone \n</li><li>ARP Main Studs</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Pistons: </b></p><ul><li>Mahle Forged pistons with AntiFriction Coating</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Bearings: </b></p><ul><li>Clevite HSeries Main and Rod Bearings</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Lifters:</b> </p><ul><li>Comp Cams Hydraulic Roller</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Covers: </b></p><ul><li>GM Factory Oil Pan \n</li><li>GM Factory LT1 Timing Cover</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Gaskets: \n</b></p><ul><li>Fel Pro Head Gaskets .040” \t \n</li><li>Fel Pro Performance Oil Pan, Timing Cover Gaskets</li></ul><p><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>Crank: </b></p><ul><li>Scat 9000 Series Cast Steel \n</li><li>3.750” stroke \n</li><li>Internally Balanced Front and Rear</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Rods: </b></p><ul><li>Scat 4340 Forged IBeam \n</li><li>6.000” length \n</li><li>ARP  Rod Bolts</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Rings: </b></p><ul><li>Mahle Plasma rings</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Camshaft: </b></p><ul><li>Comp Cams Hydraulic Roller</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Timing Sets: </b></p><ul><li>Cloyes Billet Extreme Duty Roller Timing Set</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Oil Delivery: </b></p><ul><li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Melling Select Performance \n</li><li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Melling Pick Up Tube Tig Welded \n</li><li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Melling HD Drive</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "22px",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-1i1",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "font-size": "20px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title DIV": {
              "font-size": "36px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title SPAN": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "font-size": "46px"
            }
          },
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#ffffff"
          },
          "title": "<span style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;\">CYLINDER HEAD SPECIFICATIONS</span>",
          "meta": "ZZ",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-1i2",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b>Type: </b></p><ul><li>GM Aluminum LT1 Castings</li><li>Three Angle Performance Valve Job \t       \n</li><li>Bowl and Slight Runner Porting</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Intake Valves:</b>&nbsp;<br></p><ul><li>Manley Stainless Steel  2.00\"</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Exhaust Valves:</b></p><ul><li>Manley Stainless Steel 1.56”&nbsp;</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Pushrods:</b></p><ul><li>Smith Brothers 5/16 .083” Wall Hardened</li></ul><p><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>Combustion Chamber:</b></p><ul><li>50cc Combustion Chambers</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Spring Package:</b></p><ul><li>Comp Cams Double Valve Springs</li><li>Comp Cams Hardened Retainers and Locks</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Head Bolts:</b></p><ul><li>ARP Performance</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Rocker Arms:</b></p><ul><li>Comp Cams Ultra Pro Magnum 1.6 ratio</li><li>ARP 7/16 Rocker Studs</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "22px",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-1i3",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": "3",
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text": "<p>Here at Golen Engine we build each LT1 Street engine with the same meticulous process used in our line of racing engines to ensure top quality performance and reliability throughout its lifetime.  \n</p><p><br></p><p>When you purchase one of our LT1 High Performance Street Engines you will receive a full spec sheet listing the exact components your engine was built with. We will also provide you with a complete Set Up Guide as well as full phone tech support \nto aid you with the installation process. It is mandatory for you to contact Golen Engine Tech Support before starting your engine for the first time and you can reach our Tech Support Line at <a href=\"tel:1-800-591-9171\" class=\"text-warning\">1-800-591-9171</a> ext 2. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Each Golen Engine Performance Street Engine comes standard with a “<b>Three Year no Mileage Limit Warranty</b>” to keep you confident and covered! \n</p><p>We are able to custom build your engine to match just about any specs you desire and offer a long list of proven upgrades, so if you do not see it just ask us!</p><p><br></p><p> \n</p><p>Feel free to contact us anytime for help choosing the perfect performance engine combination!! \n</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you,  \n</p><p>Golen Engine</p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-1i4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
