        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text": "<div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">We offer custom road race engine builds for all classes SCCA and NASA. We specialize in the Chevy LS Series but also build quite a few Small Block Chevy and Ford race engines as well. We have the latest technology in machining equipment to properly blue print each engine for longevity and performance. Offering dry sump systems from Daily and ARE we can supply a system that fits your race car without a problem.</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><ul><li>Custom engine design\n</li><li>Power levels up to 1000hp\n</li><li>Dry Sump Systems\n</li><li>Free estimates</li></ul>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_styles": {
            "UL": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content1-1kr",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text": "<p>Questions? Give us a call at <a href=\"tel:1-800-591-9171\" class=\"text-warning\">1-800-591-9171</a> or <a href=\"contact-us.html\" class=\"text-warning\">Contact Us</a> and we’ll get in touch with you right away.</p>",
