          "text": "<div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We offer custom engines for all classes of off road racing and have many racers in both Class One and the Ultra 4 series. While the LSx engine is the most popular that we build we also offer both small and big block Chevy engines as well. We can set these engines up with Carb or EFI and Wet or Dry sump oiling options.&nbsp;</span><br></div>",
